Subject: [PATCH net-next v2 1/7] net: stmmac: allow platforms to use PHY tx
 clock stop capability
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1tsITp-005vG9-Px@rmk-PC.armlinux.org.uk>
